# The Bluetooth AP (the "ble" variant of a board in board.json, docs/ble-tags.md): read after the
# board's defaults and the manifest's (manifest.py) by "python build.py --ble <board>" or
# idf.py -D VARIANT=ble. The variant has no 802.15.4 radio, so the manifest sets the stub radio
# mode and the Gicisky protocol's own sdkconfig (protocols/gicisky.sdkconfig) brings NimBLE.

# Two larger app slots: the BLE image is about 1.6 MB, and a Bluetooth AP has no
# 802.15.4 tag firmware partition to keep.
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="ble.partitions.csv"
